# AATA — abstract algebra, verified in bpa

This directory holds **literate bpa translations of theorems and exercises from
*Abstract Algebra: Theory and Applications*** by Thomas W. Judson (the "AATA"
textbook). Each `.md` file is prose interleaved with ` ```bpa ` proof blocks,
checked directly:

```
bpa check aata/groups.md
```

The document map mirrors the textbook's own structure
(`vendor/aata/src/aata.xml`), translated a chapter at a time, as far as bpa's
first-order-logic kernel can currently express.

## Attribution and license

The source textbook is vendored as a git submodule at **`vendor/aata`**
(`github.com/twjudson/aata`).

